        "Description": "Good evening, Agent. We have linked five VIPs at the Palais de Walewska to a global syndicate called The Velvet Vanguard, which bridges high-society luxury with underground military operations.\r\rEliminate the targets:\r• Al-Ghazali (Financier)\r• Martínez (Broker)\r• Decker (Liaison)\r• Kruger (Courier)\r• Bolduc (CICADA Insider)\r\rSever the Vanguard&apos;s ties here before their global network mobilizes. Good luck.",
